### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### List tools
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tools

### Chat (requires LLM_API_KEY configured for intent routing)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain FIN.P2P.AP.0001"
}

### Call a tool directly (works with no LLM configured)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tools/get_script_by_identifier
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "FIN.P2P.AP.0001"
}
